  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The game can enter a state where it will freeze every few seconds, for 2 seconds upon selfie expression attempting to access a removed device.\n\nReproduction:\n\n1. Use a phone as a webcam device for Selfie Expression, plugged in via USB. (Android?)\n\n2. Close the game, while selfie expression is on/active with that camera.\n\n3. Unplug the phone.\n\n4. Restart the game, you will experience freezes every couple of seconds.\n\nCause:\n\nUpon removing the webcam, the game remembers the device as the last used one, and will repeatedly attempt to connect to it while selfie expression is on. The game will attempt to open a webcam stream every ~3-5s to the removed device, hanging the game for 2s as the main thread is attempting to open a stream to the webcam",
